name advice
category Package
revision 69283
shortdesc Extend commands and environments
relocated 1
longdesc Like its namesake from the Emacs world, this cross-format
longdesc package implements a generic framework for extending the
longdesc functionality of selected commands and environments. It was
longdesc developed as an auxiliary package of Memoize. This is why it
longdesc is, somewhat unconventionally, documented alongside that
longdesc package. This applies to both the manual and the documented
longdesc code listing.
runfiles size=15
